license: "MIT"
abstract: >
  KnotPy is a Python 3.10+ library for the manipulation, analysis, and
  visualization of knots, links, knotoids, and spatial graphs. It supports
  Reidemeister moves, computation of polynomial invariants, and tools for
  topological research and education.
